Generate a standalone C reproducer that triggers this vulnerability:

File: contrib/mfs/mfs_file.c
Line: 329
Function: mfs_read
Bug type: out-of-bounds-read
CWE: CWE-125
Explanation: No bounds check on fd before indexing fds[fd] and buf_mode[fd]; a negative or >= MAX_BUFFS fd leads to out-of-bounds access.

